=== {{S|adjectif|fr}} ===
{{fr-accord-rég|bʁɑ̃.ʃe}}
[[File:Colorful Bird 2.jpg|thumb|redresse|Oiseau '''branché''' (sens 1).]]
[[File:Dates on date palm.jpg|thumb|redresse|Dattes '''branchées''' (sens 2).]]
